Abstract = {This paper presents transformer-based models for the ``Abusive Comment
   Detection{''} shared task at the Second Workshop on Speech and Language
   Technologies for Dravidian Languages at ACL 2022. Our team participated
   in both the multi-class classification sub-tasks as a part of this
