   Gokhale, Omkar; Kane, Aditya; Patankar, Shantanu, Georgia Inst Technol, L3Cube, Atlanta, GA USA.
   Joshi, Raviraj, Indian Inst Technol Madras, L3Cube, Chennai, Tamil Nadu, India.},
ISBN = {979-8-89176-018-9},
Research-Areas = {Computer Science; Linguistics},
